he  commissioner and her office has been  called into question  there is a high cost to their  credibility  if a  strong  and detailed report doesn't emerge from  all of this  beijing has denied claims of  mistreatment against the muslim weaker  minority calling them the lie of the  century  katrina you al jazeera beijing
 

